Subspecies
Seven subspecies are recognised by Plants of the World Online {{As of|2024|03|08|lc=y}}, as follows:
C. j. subsp. agnes (de Wit) K.Larsen – synonyms Cassia agnes {{small|(de Wit) [[Brenan]]}}, Cassia javanica var. agnes {{small|de Wit}}, Cassia indochinensis {{small|([[François Gagnepain|Gagnep.]]) [[Vijendra Singh|V.Singh]]}}, Cassia javanica var. indochinensis {{small|Gagnep.}}{{R|POWO1}}
C. j. subsp. bartonii (F.M.Bailey) K.Larsen – synonym Cassia bartonii {{small|F.M.Bailey}}{{R|POWO2}}
C. j. subsp. javanica L. 
C. j. subsp. microcalyx (H.S.Irwin & Barneby) K.Larsen – synonym Cassia javanica var. microcalyx {{small|H.S.Irwin & Barneby}}{{R|POWO3}}
C. j. subsp. nodosa (Buch.-Ham. ex Roxb.) K.Larsen & S.S.Larsen – synonyms Cassia nodosa {{small|Buch.-Ham. ex Roxb.}}, Cathartocarpus nodosus {{small|(Buch.-Ham. ex Roxb.) [[Ernst Gottlieb von Steudel|Steud.]]}}{{R|POWO4}}
C. j. subsp. pubiflora (Merr.) K.Larsen – synonym assia javanica var. pubiflora {{small|Merr.}}{{R|POWO5}}
C. j. subsp. renigera (Wall. ex Benth.) K.Larsen – synonym Cassia renigera {{small|Wall. ex Benth.}}{{R|POWO6}}
